  "body": "## What's changed\n\n- A bucket object with no extension opens as the same file on disk would: Parquet in place, anything else downloaded and read by its bytes, or shown as hex, instead of failing as Parquet\n- `Open all` says what it reads (`3 CSV files, 1 JSON file skipped`) instead of `mixed files`, and is no longer offered on a bucket prefix that holds only sub-prefixes or nothing it can read\n"
